  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN202.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">iravukkuṟi vantu nīṅkun talaimakaṟkut tōḻi colli varaivu kaṭāyatu.
          </p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">How the confidante urged for marriage, speaking to HIM who left after having come for the night tryst.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN202.1">
        <l>vayaṅkuveḷ ḷaruviya kuṉṟattuk kavā<supplied>a</supplied>ṟ</l>
        <l><supplied>ka</supplied>yantalai maṭappiṭi yiṉṉē mārppap</l>
        <l>pulippakai veṉṟa puṇarkūr yāṉai</l>
        <l>kallakac cilampiṟ kaiyeṭut tuyirppi</l>
        <l>ṉalli<supplied>ṇa</supplied>r vēṅkai naṟuvī kollaṉ</l>
        <l>kurukūtu mitiyulaip pitirviṟ poṅkic</l>
        <l>ciṟupaṉ miṉmiṉi pōlap palavuṭaṉ</l>
        <l>maṇiniṟa virumputaṟ ṟāvu nāṭa</l>
        <l>yāmē yaṉṟiyu muḷarkol pāṉā</l>
        <l>ḷutti yaraviṉ paittalai tumiya</l>
        <l>vu<supplied>ra</supplied>vuru muraṟu <supplied>mu</supplied>ṭkuvaru naṉantalait</l>
        <l>tavirvi luḷḷamō ṭeḵ<supplied>ku</supplied>tuṇai yākak</l>
        <l>kaṉaiyiruḷ paranta kallakac ciṟuneṟi</l>
        <l>tērātu varūu niṉvayi</l>
        <l>ṉāraña rarumpaṭar nīntu vōrē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l>O man from a land where on dark bushes of sapphire colour,</l>
        <l>flying like the sparks from the furnace,</l>
        <l>as the smith treads, so that the bellows’ hole blows,</l>
        <l>the fragrant blossom of the kino tree, many together,</l>
        <l corresp="5-8">like many little fireflies, spread in fine clusters,</l>
        <l>because on the mountain side  in the rocks the elephant, keen in mating </l>
        <l corresp="3f">who had vanquished the tiger’s enmity, raises [its] trunk [and] sighs</l>
        <l corresp="2">while the herd of youthful elephant cows with soft heads trumpets in joy,</l>
        <l corresp="1">on the slope of the hill with glittering white waterfalls,</l>
        <l corresp="9">if not for us, will they exist,  at midnight,</l>
        <l corresp="15">– they who cross rare grief, difficult affliction</l>
        <l corresp="14">on account of you who comes without searching</l>
        <l corresp="13">the little paths within the rocks that spread in dense darkness,</l>
        <l corresp="12">with [your] blade for a companion, with unrestrained mind,</l>
        <l corresp="11">in the dreadful vast area, where strong thunder roars</l>
        <l corresp="10">so as to cut off the hooded heads of spotted snakes?</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

